  "details": "I have a few avatars in my scene, that are all based on one prefab and have only minor changes.\nWhenever I upload them I need to upload all.\nhowever they are not sorted in the order they should be in, which makes it harder to see which one the last was I uploaded, and which one the next would be.\nTherefore I dug a bit into C# list sorting and added this line to VRCSdkControlPanelAvatarBuilder.cs\nallAvatars.Sort((descriptor1, descriptor2) => string.Compare(descriptor1.gameObject.name, descriptor2.gameObject.name, StringComparison.CurrentCultureIgnoreCase));\nI hope you can implement it in the SDK, so that everyone can enjoy a sorted avatar list.\nbefore and after attatched",
